[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7620.239, "timestamp": "02:07:00", "text": "你想要哪一个？ 彩色球体在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7623.28, "timestamp": "02:07:03", "text": "彩色球体在哪里？ 哦不，不。我指的是厚实的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7627.47, "timestamp": "02:07:07", "text": "哦不，不。我指的是厚实的。 [音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7634.79, "timestamp": "02:07:14", "text": "目标就是你的目标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7635.189, "timestamp": "02:07:15", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7638.31, "timestamp": "02:07:18", "text": "是的，是Target。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7641.589, "timestamp": "02:07:21", "text": "你的目标是自己吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7643.83, "timestamp": "02:07:23", "text": "我变身成球体时的样子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7644.39, "timestamp": "02:07:24", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7645.99, "timestamp": "02:07:25", "text": "按 C 键。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7649.35, "timestamp": "02:07:29", "text": "是的。按 T​​ 键。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7651.109, "timestamp": "02:07:31", "text": "你可以看到上面有个小点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7653.109, "timestamp": "02:07:33", "text": "它。这意味着它是针对特定目标的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7655.73, "timestamp": "02:07:35", "text": "好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7658.39, "timestamp": "02:07:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7660.31, "timestamp": "02:07:40", "text": "如果它有紫色的话。是的。如果它有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7661.589, "timestamp": "02:07:41", "text": "紫色圆点，那意味着你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7663.669, "timestamp": "02:07:43", "text": "因为你的颜色是紫色，所以针对你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7664.31, "timestamp": "02:07:44", "text": "你可以改变这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7667.27, "timestamp": "02:07:47", "text": "你可以使用这个法术。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7669.51, "timestamp": "02:07:49", "text": "是的。是的。我以为我仍然可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7671.51, "timestamp": "02:07:51", "text": "召唤史蒂夫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7675.03, "timestamp": "02:07:55", "text": "对，是马。好的，"},